  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Mbandaka City Clean Energy Ecosystem Feasibility Study, through AEG International</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to the provincial Government of quateur funds a feasibility study that would assess the economic and technical viability and perform an environmental and social impact assessment for a comprehensive clean energy ecosystem for the city of Mbandaka in the Democratic Republic of the Congo: a utility scale solar photovoltaic (PV), and battery energy storage system (BESS); and a small-scale solar PV system and BESS electric vehicle charging station. The U.S. company, AEG International, is the sole-source contractor for the feasibility study.</narrative>
  </description>
